ndex":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"没事，东西掉了","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:3:607:0":{"key":"document:3:607:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"3","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"梅林：\n注意到你曾前往苍骸花海，且与一位被赤烛蕊感染的生者同行，特送来相关情报。\n<style=\"highlight\">黑金商会</style>曾计划利用赤烛蕊危害耀光帝国，海歌剧院所发放的纪念品即是其中之一。赤烛蕊对生者的具体危害如下：\n（下面贴着一小张经过剪裁的信纸，字迹与上面完全不同）\n\n赤烛蕊以生命力为养料。生者一旦接触，即刻便会被寄生，随之可能出现的症状包括幻觉、五感麻痹甚至丧失，直至赤烛蕊遍布全身，失去生命。\n生者死后，<style=\"highlight\">赤烛蕊将以其死地为中心向外扩散</style>，寻找其他寄生对象。因此，若赤烛蕊传入生者聚集地，必将<style=\"highlight\">造成瘟疫</style>。\n基于同样的原理，赤烛蕊可用于处理仍蕴含生命力的废肢，但其对亡灵躯体的影响微乎其微，推测原因是其排斥维持亡灵生存的死亡之力。\n\n（以下部分的字迹与前几段相同）\n偷渡者所接受之伪装魔法同样源于死亡之力，在魔法解除前不会被赤烛蕊感染。演出结束前他们无法离开诺珐斯，不必担心。做好伪装，保护自己。\n<align=\"right\">莫德雷德","textdes_id":"607","document_page_count":"3","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item13.png","document_image_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/item_quest_mapstory_item13.png","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item13.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"true"},"say:4:1810509001:0":{"key":"say:4:1810509001:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1810509001","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"密信中透露的内容令你毛骨悚然——<style=high...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1810509002:0":{"key":"say:5:1810509002:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","s